window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She was once powerless. Now, she will decide the fate of a dying realm.</b></p> <p>Vellene Winloc fears the tyrannical blood in her veins. But her first kill has stripped her of innocence, and the more she wields her power, the less she resists its hunger. Every Winloc is destined to destroy, and she is no exception.</p> <p>Mogaell Winloc was never given a choice. The power of Death was forced upon her as a child, twisting her soul into something unrecognizable. Now, she fights not for conquest or revenge—but for the one thing she has never known: freedom.</p> <p>Caught between the sisters' war, Eledar Lirik and Kadir Rathmore are desperate to end the Winloc reign before it consumes the realm. The two men should have been enemies, but instead find themselves bound by grief, love, and the woman they thought lost.</p> <p>Fury. Death. Sacrifice. Forged.</p> <p>Welcome to the tragic finale of Alchemight—a dark, harrowing tale of power, ruin, and love.</p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
